# GeYiProxy update.manifest - publish this file on the update source.
# Copy it next to the new 格一代理.exe, fill VER/BUILD/URL/SHA256/SIZE, then
# set PHASE=canary FIRST. Only hosts listed in CANARY_HOSTS may auto-install.
# After the canary host passes (version changed + tray alive + verify=PASS +
# clean rollback), change PHASE=all to release to every client.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# VER               semantic version, must be greater than the installed one
# BUILD             build stamp; a new BUILD with the same VER also triggers upgrade
# URL               absolute URL/UNC/local path of the new exe
#                   (relative paths are resolved against the manifest location)
# SHA256            hex SHA256 of the new exe, mandatory (refuse on mismatch)
# SIZE              byte length of the new exe, mandatory
# PHASE             canary | all | hold
# CANARY_HOSTS      comma separated NetBIOS names allowed at PHASE=canary
# NOTE              shown in the tray balloon / config window
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
VER=1.1.0
BUILD=20261114-1
URL=格一代理.exe
SHA256=
SIZE=
PHASE=canary
CANARY_HOSTS=mingjiu-pc
NOTE=格一代理 正式版
